# Who reviews what. GitHub asks the owners of every file a pull request touches; the last matching line wins.
#
# Adding a vendor maintainer: give them write access (or add them to a team that has it), then put their handle after the vendor's
# folder below, for example  /vendors/misumi/  @raykholo @their-handle  . A maintainer of one series or one generator gets a longer
# path: /vendors/misumi/hfs/extrusion/ . They then review changes to their folders; the maintainer stays on every line.
# Turn on "Require review from Code Owners" in the branch protection of main to make the review binding.

# Shared code, tools, workflows and docs
*                    @raykholo

# Vendors (one line per vendor folder)
/vendors/hiwin/      @raykholo
/vendors/misumi/     @raykholo
